+# Client changes: email address, contact form, month tabs – 22 Nov 2026
+
+1. **Email address.** The old `info@pe-fea.com` is not hard-coded in the pages; it is saved as content in the database (the "Contact email" setting and the About/legal page text). `prisma/seed.ts` now uses `info@fea-training.com`. For the live database run `pnpm exec tsx scripts/replace-email.ts` (dry run, lists every place), then add `--apply`. It changes only the exact address, never touches users, orders or contact messages, and lists any other `pe-fea.com` text (for example a web address) without changing it.
+2. **Contact form.** Every message is saved (Admin → Messages) and now emailed to the contact inbox with the sender's name, email and message, and Reply-To set to the sender. Before, nothing was really sent: with no SMTP host set the email only went to the server log. Recipient: `CONTACT_TO_EMAIL`, else the Admin "Contact email" setting, else `info@fea-training.com`. SMTP is read from the environment `SMTP_HOST`, `SMTP_PORT`, `SMTP_USER`, `SMTP_PASSWORD`, `SMTP_FROM`), else from Admin → Settings → SMTP. Spam protection: a hidden field (bots are ignored silently) and a limit of 5 messages per 15 minutes per address.
+3. **Upcoming courses: 12 month tabs.** January to December plus "In progress". New `Course.upcomingMonth` (1–12) with a "Planned month" box in the course editor (shown when Status is Upcoming). A month with no course shows "In progress"; a course with no month is listed under the "In progress" tab. Needs the migration `20261122140000_upcoming_month` `pnpm exec prisma migrate deploy`).
+4. **Wording.** Events tile on the home page now reads "Workshops and webinars."
+
+Tests: `tests/unit/upcoming-months.test.ts`, `tests/unit/contact-form.test.ts`.
+
 # Lesson locks + quiz form – 22 Nov 2026
 
 Students now go through Part 9 one video at a time, enforced on the server.
